sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    Client ->> Backend: POST /api/auth/login (email, password)
    Backend ->> Database: Find user by email
    Database -->> Backend: Return UserAccount entity (with bcrypt hash)
    Backend ->> Backend: Verify password matches bcrypt hash
    alt Credentials Valid
        Backend ->> Backend: Add email attribute to HttpSession
        Backend -->> Client: Return 200 OK + Session Cookie (JSESSIONID)
    else Credentials Invalid
        Backend -->> Client: Return 401 Unauthorized
    end
